{"product_id":"book-keeping-made-simple-made-simple-books","title":"Book-Keeping Made Simple (Made Simple Books)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA classic title in the Made Simple Series, Book-keeping has now been fully updated to reflect changes in accounting practice. All balance sheets are now displayed in the commonly used European style. New illustrations feature in the book, along with a basic book-keeping and computerized book-keeping chart. Suitable for students taking introductory exams in accounting, including GCSE, BTEC National, RSA, LCCI and other courses corresponding to NVQ level 2. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:189 x 250  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Geoffrey Whitehead \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780750636513 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 396\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44268793135257,"sku":"2EDU9780750636513","price":30.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/c332c0463331c6450cb7b11f48e98a83.jpg?v=1714568259","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/book-keeping-made-simple-made-simple-books","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}